2026-09-24T00:30:47.7578979Z   mirror: |
2026-09-24T00:30:47.7579424Z     SSTATE_MIRRORS = "file://.* http://sstate.yoctoproject.org/all/PATH;downloadfilename=PATH"
2026-09-24T00:30:47.7579803Z   ccache: |
